    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variance is a free-to-play Anime Roguelite RPG. Play as Ella, as she battles through relentless foes, explores new levels, and masters powerful abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a Variant that matches your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your abilities every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your  abilities and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics to personalize your Variant</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Variant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of characters, each with their own playstyle. Unlock new Variants as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682880/extras/04d6960f2121e91821eea98b0711f055.avif?t=1746664368\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining fast-paced platforming combat and seasonal expansions. Variance creates a new genre hybrid of roguelike action and  RPG progression. Explore new levels and unlock new abilities as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682880/extras/af129618e4aeeaa5db5a88ab82d2ca0c.avif?t=1746664368\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Service</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variance merges the high-replayability of roguelike gameplay with the depth of live-service content and creating the first anime-inspired roguelike RPG.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variance is a free-to-play Anime Roguelite RPG. Play as Ella, as she battles through relentless foes, explores new levels, and masters powerful abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a Variant that matches your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your abilities every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your  abilities and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics to personalize your Variant</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Variant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of characters, each with their own playstyle. Unlock new Variants as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682880/extras/04d6960f2121e91821eea98b0711f055.avif?t=1746664368\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining fast-paced platforming combat and seasonal expansions. Variance creates a new genre hybrid of roguelike action and  RPG progression. Explore new levels and unlock new abilities as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682880/extras/af129618e4aeeaa5db5a88ab82d2ca0c.avif?t=1746664368\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Service</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variance merges the high-replayability of roguelike gameplay with the depth of live-service content and creating the first anime-inspired roguelike RPG.</p>",
